        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "b",
          "value": "<ol>\n<li>(1-2) Helpers, 8. A mason, 5.</li>\n<li>&nbsp;</li>\n<li>(3-4) A meal, 1&frac12;. A crowbar, &frac14;. A carpenter, 3</li>\n<li>&nbsp;</li>\n<li>(5-7) Supervision, three days, 6. A ladder, &frac34;.</li>\n<li>&nbsp;</li>\n<li>&nbsp;</li>\n<li>On the 6th of Adar 127:</li>\n<li>(9-12) A meal, 2. A mason, 5. The helpers, 12. Supervision, 2.</li>\n<li>&nbsp;</li>\n<li>&nbsp;</li>\n<li>&nbsp;</li>\n<li>(13-15) &hellip;. Renting &hellip;. the room of Asad, 12.</li>\n<li>&nbsp;</li>\n<li>&nbsp;</li>\n<li>(16-17) A meal, 2. Three helpers, 12.</li>\n<li>&nbsp;</li>\n<li>(18-23) A ladder &hellip;. The ladder, &frac14;. A mason, 5. Supervision &hellip;. n\u0101sh\u016bsh &hellip;. Clay, 3&hellip;.</li>\n<li>&nbsp;</li>\n<li>&nbsp;</li>\n<li>&nbsp;</li>\n<li>&nbsp;</li>\n<li>&nbsp;</li>\n</ol>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
