      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "c",
          "value": "<ol>\n<li>(1-2) On the 13th of Adar, 127 of the documents,</li>\n<li>&nbsp;</li>\n<li>regarding the expenditures in D\u0101r</li>\n<li>Asad and D\u0101r (A)b\u016b\u02bel-Mun\u0101:</li>\n<li>(5-6) A clay worker, 5. A meal, 2. Helpers, 8.</li>\n<li>&nbsp;</li>\n<li>(7-8) A mason, 5. Gypsum, 8. Floor tiles, 5&frac12;.</li>\n<li>&nbsp;</li>\n<li>(9-10) Supervision, 2. (Total,) 35&frac12;.</li>\n<li>&nbsp;</li>\n<li>(11-12) In the Synagogue of the Palestinians, may it prosper:</li>\n<li>&nbsp;</li>\n<li>(13-14) Tuesday, 11th of Adar 127:</li>\n<li>&nbsp;</li>\n<li>(15-16) Removal of garbage, 2. Making the pipe &hellip;.</li>\n<li>&nbsp;</li>\n<li>(17-18) A meal, 1. A buckle, 3.</li>\n<li>&nbsp;</li>\n<li>(19-20) Two baskets, 1. Oil, &frac14;.</li>\n<li>&nbsp;</li>\n<li>(21-22) Supervision, 2.</li>\n<li>&nbsp;</li>\n</ol>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
